      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -504,
        -280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Client inbox to CRM agent\n\n**Reference architecture.**\n\nEvery client email is matched to the right person and the right open deal, saved against the record, summarised, and classified by intent.\n\nAn AI agent does the matching, and asks for a human when it can't be sure. Intent then drives what happens: interested leads alert the owner, confirmations advance the stage, clear declines get a polite close.\n\nUnknown senders and ambiguous matches go to Slack instead of being guessed.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 560,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
